ET:"Level - Start";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"P Switch - Start";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"P Switch - End";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Sonic talk";MG:"You don't say! You just appeared here after crashing in your plane!? Hm... Well\, let me tell you something\, the Dream World isn't safe! It is just as terrible as the Illusion World!!!";TE:"Sonic talk 2";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Sonic talk 2";MG:"OK\, I need your help! Tails and Knuckles are in this forest and all three of us are looking for Eggman. Do you think you can help a hedgehog out by tracking him down with us? ...  Great! There is no time to waste\; get moving!";TE:"Sonic talk 3";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Sonic talk 3";MG:"Oh\, and one more thing! This part of the Dream Island is based a lot off of our world... So\, um yeah you may want to be careful...";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Locked door hide";SD:43;LH:["Locked door"];TE:"unlocked door show";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"unlocked door show";LS:["unlocked door"];AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Eggman talk 1";MG:"Dr. Eggman\:     Well\, look who else joined the party... I hope you wern't expecting a cup of tea! Oh\, ho\, ho\, ho!!!";TE:"Eggman talk 2";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Eggman talk 2";MG:"Sonic\:   Enough games Eggman! We all know you are behind this Dream plan!";TE:"Eggman talk 3";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Eggman talk 3";MG:"Dr. Eggman\:  ???  Oh\, you mean sending every world in the universe to the Island of Dreams and Illusions!  Alright\, I admit it! I was behind it...";TE:"Eggman talk 4";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Eggman talk 4";MG:"Tails\:  I knew it! But\, why did you bring every one here in the first place anyway?";TE:"Eggman talk 5";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Eggman talk 5";MG:"Dr. Eggman\:  So many questions at one time! You are all a pain in the neck\, so why don't you just live in the Dream world... FOREVER!!! Oh\, ho\, ho\, ho!";TE:"Eggman talk 6";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Eggman talk 6";MG:"Sonic\:  Well\, one thing I do know is\, that you have all seven Chaos Emeralds!";TE:"Eggman talk 7";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Eggman talk 7";MG:"Dr. Eggman\:   OK\, fine you get a few points for finding that out\, but you will never find them all! I hid them all over the place! Oh\, ho\, ho\, ho!";TE:"Eggman talk 8";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Eggman talk 8";MG:"Dr. Eggman\:  Now if you don't mind\, I've got to go. I will let my son deal with you! Oh\, ho\, ho\, ho! Bye-bye!!!";TE:"Eggman move";TD:10;AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Eggman move";TE:"Black door show";TD:15;ML:"Dr. Eggman";MX:-4;MY:0;MLA:["LN\:\"Dr. Eggman\"\;SX\:-4\;"];AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Black door show";LS:["Black door"];AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Eggman son talk 1";MG:"Ha\, you want to challenge me? What a joke\, but if you insist!!!";AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"Eggman son talk 2";MG:"Noo! I let my father down... You will pay for this!";TE:"End show";TD:34;AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
ET:"End show";LS:["end"];AS:0;AX:0;AY:0;
EVENTS_CLASSIC_END
